                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Once per battle, you can modify the result of a hit roll, wound roll or saving throw made for this Warlord to a 6
- Once per battle, you can use an Adeptus Astartes Epic Deed Stratagem without spending any CP&apos;s if this Warlord is the model specified by that Stratagem&apos;s keyword</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
